tions are billed automatically at the rate depending on the selected subscription plan.<br><br>By using the app, you confirm that you acknowledge and accept our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use:<br>Privacy Policy: https://novaapp.ai/privacy<br>Terms of Service: https://novaapp.ai/terms<br><br>Do you have a question for us?<br>support@novaapp.ai",
